1. Data Quality Validation Rules
  Null Values --Mandatory fields cannot be null
  Duplicate Events --Unique event/reading check
  Schema Violations --Format & data type integrity
  Outliers (Range/Z-Score) --Sensor values within realistic physical bounds
  Late Arriving Data --Detect delayed telemetry transmissions
  Missing Records --Gaps in continuous sensor reporting

2. Error Handling Strategy
Valid Data Routing: Records passing all data quality rules are loaded directly into standard Silver tables.
Audit Trail: Every pipeline run logs metadata metrics (total processed, valid count, quarantine count, failure rate %).

